flowchart LR
    U[Requester / Procurement / Manager] --> UI[Web Interface]
    UI --> APP[Application Service]
    APP --> IAM[Identity & Role Management]
    APP --> WF[Workflow & Validation]
    WF --> AUD[Audit Event Store]
    WF --> NOTIF[Notification Service]
    APP --> REP[Reporting Layer]
    APP -. controlled API .-> ERP[ERP / Finance System]
    AI[Optional AI Draft Assistant] -. suggestions only .-> APP
    AI -. no approval authority .-> HUMAN[Authorized Human Approver]
